  "title": "South Plains Financial, Inc. Announces Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Call",
  "summary": "LUBBOCK, Texas, July 07, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- South Plains Financial, Inc. (NASDAQ:SPFI) (“South Plains” or the “Company”), the parent company of City Bank, today announced that its second quarter 2026 financial results will be released before the market opens on Friday, July 17, 2026.",
